    dict(key='16-act-4-figure', kind='figure', title="Ana's devices after each way of ending",
         body='ending',
         narration="Fourth demo: ending sessions on the server. [[slnc 400]] Plain sign out first: the record leaves Redis, so a copy of the cookie gets four oh one. [[slnc 700]] This picture shows Ana's devices: phone, laptop, tablet, and later a watch. [[slnc 300]] Spring Session keeps an index by customer name, so the bank can find every session of Ana. [[slnc 700]] First row: sign out everywhere, from the laptop. [[slnc 300]] All three sessions end. [[slnc 700]] Second row: a password change on the laptop. [[slnc 300]] The two other sessions end. [[slnc 300]] The laptop goes on, with a new id. [[slnc 700]] Third row: a limit of three sessions. [[slnc 300]] A fourth sign in, on the watch, ends the oldest: the phone."),
