    dict(key='22-costs', kind='bullets', title='What It Costs',
         body=['Redis is part of every request', 'Redis holds every live id as it is', 'Ended sessions stay in Redis five more minutes', 'A short idle timeout annoys customers', 'Operations work moves to Redis'],
         narration='Nothing is free. [[slnc 400]] Here is what moving sessions costs. [[slnc 500]] Redis is now part of every request, so when it stops, the bank stops. [[slnc 500]] Redis holds every live session id as it is, so a copy of its keys is a copy of every session. [[slnc 500]] Ended sessions stay in Redis for five more minutes. [[slnc 500]] A short idle timeout protects customers, and annoys them. [[slnc 300]] And Redis needs passwords, backups, and patching of its own.'),
